WEBVTT

00:01.200 --> 00:07.240
Since there's a river to the west and grass on the hills the Wuzhao's main force is cavalry.

00:07.320 --> 00:12.240
Their warhorses are like their wives and sons so.

00:12.320 --> 00:18.640
Their main force should be in the west to avoid the enemy's main force tonight raid the eastern camp.

00:18.840 --> 00:23.720
Brother-in-law I ask to lead the cavalry out of the city they are all brothers who have followed me.

00:23.800 --> 00:27.280
Since I joined the army each willing to fight to the death.

